title: ZoneSombre_First
position: 0,0.5
---
Bulle : It's already the night?
Astère : Yes, Bulle, go to sleep lil buddy.
Astère : ...
<<wait 0.5>>
Astère : No, Bulle, it's a Dark Area.
<<BulleAnim Sad>>
Bulle : It's scary...
<<BulleAnim Idle>>
Astère : You might see better with some light. 
===
