title: UberFish_Intro
position: 0,0.5
---
Ver : Why are you bothering me during my nap? 
Bulle : Eeeh, I just wanted to see what was that thing. 
Ver : Well "that thing" is an Uberfish.
Ver : If you want to go fast talk to me and I call a driver, bro.
Ver : So, where you wanna go? I have other fishes to fry.
->Abysses 
    Ver : Billy is coming.
    Ver : One advice for the <color=\#48BC0D>abysses</color>: don't eat too much ra-fishes, it destroyed me so much you have idea.
->Cave
    Ver : Jason is coming, that man's the best.
    Ver : In the <color=\#48BC0D>cave</color> take a GPS, my bro Camille got lost and I never saw him again. It's been 10 years. RIP.
->Cimetery
    Ver : Beverly is arriving soon.
    Ver : Take a puffa for the <color=\#48BC0D>cemetary</color> man, if you don't wanna get wet to the skin.
->Forest
    Ver : Kimberley is on her way.
    Ver : In the <color=\#48BC0D>forest</color>, be careful with the young delinquents there. They're the kids of the sister of my uncle's father, they have no education.
===
title: Uberfish_End
position: 0,0.5
---
Ver : Thanks for using UberFish, don't forget to rate your drive!
->Bulle : 0 stars <<if $seum > 20 >> 
    Driver : I'd like to see you drive in these conditions!!!
->Bulle : 1 star
    Driver : You could give me more, it's not cool.
->Bulle : 2 stars
    Driver : Neither good nor bad, as I always was... I'm an mid person, thanks for reminding it to me...
->Bulle : 3 stars
    Driver : And 1, and 2, and 3 stars!!!! Thanks mister!
->Bulle : 10,000 stars <<if $seum < 20 >>
    Driver : No, it's you who deserves 10,000 stars, you're the best client in the whole sea!
===
title: Trigger_Cimetiere
position: 0,0.5
---
Bulle : It's all empty here.
Astère : It's normal, it's a cimetary.
Astère : In general deads aren't too noisy.
Bulle : Deads?
Astère : You see this big skeleton?
Astère : It used to be a whale.
Astère : She wind up here at the end of her life.
Astère : They pass on far from their families to not be a weight to them.
<<BulleAnim Sad>>
Bulle : It's so sad. They must be missing them.
<<BulleAnim Idle>>
Astère : You're far from your family too, you know.
Bulle : But I'm not the same! I'll go back to see them someday!
Astère : Oh, really? That wasn't what you were saying when you left.
Bulle : I didn't want them to be sad because of me.
Astère : Be careful not to be too sad, or you'll drown in your bubble, haha!
===
title: Trigger_Falaise
position: 0,0.5
---
Bulle : Dad would tell me to be careful not to fall.
Astère : And grandma to jump.
Bulle : And Gumpy to punch out all these shrimps that block the view!!!! 
Astère : Hahaha, they're all crazy.
Bulle : Are we crazy too?
Astère : Of course, we went through the whole sea alone with basically no knowledge, leaving mom and dad behind!
<<BulleAnim Sad>>
Bulle : I hope they're not too worried...
<<BulleAnim Idle>>
Bulle : But it was cool, no?
Astère : Not too bad. Wanna continue?
Bulle : I'd like to. There must be so many things left to see.
Astère : What's our next step then?
Bulle : I think we'll go see mom and dad.
Astère : Is it the end of the adventure, or the start of a new one?
Bulle : I don't know, but as grandma would say:
Bulle : <i>"Continue along your path, and you'll see for yourself!"</i>
Bulle : So, let's go?
===
